# First blessing approved by the maintainer on 2026-10-05 for #134; correction approved on 2026-10-07 for #392.
# Chapter 5: non-waiting sends use FIFO mailboxes, including send to me.
# A full mailbox raises at the paid send; errors precede later send records.
# Missing receivers and wrong-kind Values are caught; an already sent message
# survives the sender's error. The receiver uses its own limits.
